{"id":"n25448-1-9","stage":2,"title":"걸레 · 抹布","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25448-1-9-1","ko":"오늘 청소는 제가 도와 드릴게요.","zh":"今天打扫的工作让我来帮忙吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"청소는","meaning":"打扫，清扫，扫除","explanation":"청소：打扫，清扫，扫除；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"청소","audio":"/audio/8049e4b9139d36bf5db4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32789","senseId":"1","lemma":"청소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"청소는","audio":"/audio/2dea930f03ffa9a1100a.mp3"}},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"도와","meaning":"帮，帮助","explanation":"돕다：帮，帮助；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"돕다","audio":"/audio/7feaaecf170e0c6a578f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17203","senseId":"1","lemma":"돕다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도와","audio":"/audio/b8a529b6c5e5ec83bac8.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴게요","audio":"/audio/e61f9f5edc04f979cd3a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"80